WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Faisal: Metro station - follow this walkway, cross at the marshals, about ten minutes. Hold the children's hands. Safe journey home!

2
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:15.900
Narrator: After the final whistle, Faisal gives the same care as before kick-off: the route, the crossing, the time - and a reminder to keep the children close.

3
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.600
Narrator: Safe journey home.

